{'symbol': 'IBM', 'date': '2021-04-07 08:00:00', 'title': 'IBM CLOUD FOR FINANCIAL SERVICES ACCELERATES INNOVATION WITH SUPPORT FOR RED HAT OPENSHIFT AND OTHER CLOUD-NATIVE SERVICES', 'text': "ARMONK, N.Y., APRIL 7, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- IBM (NYSE:\xa0 IBM ) TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT THE GENERAL AVAILABILITY OF THE INDUSTRY'S FIRST FINANCIAL SERVICES-READY CLOUD PLATFORM, IBM CLOUD FOR FINANCIAL SERVICES, NOW INCLUDING THE SUPPORT FOR RED HAT OPENSHIFT AND OTHER CLOUD-NATIVE SERVICES."}